4 batches in parallel:

DB (9-a) — 8 fixes:
- M1: urgente column mapped as Boolean (was Integer)
- M2: CheckConstraints on sexo/estado/via (declarative, future-proof)
- M3: updated_at audit column on 9 tables + before_flush listener
- M5: from_row consistent access (Row._mapping.get)
- M6: movimientos.fecha_hora NOT NULL with server_default
- M7: valor_ref <-> valor_referencia synonym
- M8: package __init__.py docstrings + re-exports
- M9: AnimalService preview/consumir_codigo split (mirror of MuestraService)
New migration: b3c4d5e6f7a8 (idempotent, single head preserved).

Services/Security (9-b) — 14 fixes:
- M1: PermissionDeniedError inherits IsaLabException (PermissionError alias kept)
- M2: dead _validar methods removed from 4 services
- M5: MuestraService.generar_codigo split into preview/consumir
- M6: recepciones_hoy uses SQL WHERE via repo fecha_desde/fecha_hasta
- M7: report_laboratorio calls muestra.es_urgente() with parens
- M8: tiempo_promedio excludes negative fecha_entrega - fecha_recoleccion
- M9: tasa_cumplimiento counts Completado-with-NULL as non-compliant
- M10: configuracion_service deep merge + chmod 0o600
- M11: logger PIIRedactionFilter (bcrypt hashes, emails, passwords) + chmod 0o600
- L2: actualizar_usuario raises ValidationError on empty whitelist
- L3: actualizar_usuario validates nombre length (2-100)
- L4: crear_usuario raises ValidationError instead of ValueError
- L5: validar_fortaleza_password requires symbol (fixes instalador UI mismatch)
- L6: cambiar_password checks new != current via verify_password

GUI (9-c) — 14 fixes:
- M1: app.py _show_view(name, factory) consolidates 9 _show_X methods
- M2: theme_changed handler iterates self.views to refresh all
- M3: muestras.py unnecessary lambda removed (Qt auto-discards args)
- M4: recepcion.py N+1 query — pre-fetch all historias in one query
- M5: historia.py routed through HistoriaService.listar_historias
- M6: DataTable.populate shows empty-state row when data is empty
- M7: FormField.validate extended with min/max_length, regex, validator
- M8: LoadingOverlay used in muestra_dialog PDF generation
- M10: usuarios.py stateChanged arg handled cleanly (lambda, no *args)
- L1: LoginDialog._do_login sanitizes error (generic message + logger.error)
- L2: LoginDialog show-password toggle + caps-lock warning
- L3: splash.py WindowStaysOnTopHint added
- L4: splash.py processEvents re-entrancy guard via _processing flag
- L5: SearchBar._debounce_timer parented to self
- L6: LoadingOverlay.showEvent None guard
- L7: muestra_dialog + animal_dialog lazy generar_codigo (preview on open)
- L8: app.py DEFAULT_WINDOW_SIZE constant (consistent with setMinimumSize)
- L9: usuarios.py uses DataTable instead of QTableWidget

DevOps (9-d) — 6 fixes:
- L1: icon_manager logger uses %-format instead of f-strings (9 call sites)
- L2: config.__version__ = '1.0.0' + main.py uses it + --version flag
- L3: build_app.py --debug flag (conditional optimize=0, console=True)
- L4: IsaLab.spec optimize=2 (conditional on ISALAB_DEBUG env var)
- L5: alembic.ini ruff post_write_hooks enabled
- L6: IsaLab.spec hiddenimports audited (removed unused QtSvg/QtSvgWidgets)

Tests:
- tests/test_fase6_medium_low.py: 47 regression tests covering all 4 batches.
- tests/test_fase3_security.py: updated _setup_test_db (DROP+CREATE for
  schema freshness, DELETE FROM codigo_contadores for test isolation,
  updated_at column).
- tests/test_fase4_gui.py: same _setup_test_db treatment.
- tests/test_fase5_high.py: updated test_h_s2 for new S-L5 symbol requirement.

Verification:
- 138 passed, 7 skipped (1 new GUI skip for headless env), 1 pre-existing
  failure (alembic CLI not installed in this sandbox).
- Migration chain: single head b3c4d5e6f7a8 (verified via AST analysis).
- All 47 Phase 6 regression tests pass.

